#ASSERT (`the privileges position for` (`Privileges case` OF `a natural person`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, `none of these`, FALSE, `a member of a House`, (Date 15 3 2025), (LIST (Date 10 3 2025))))'s `I am immune from court attendance and civil arrest that day` EQUALS TRUE

