-- 20. witness required to attend that day: immune (s 14(3))
#ASSERT (`the privileges position for` (`Privileges case` OF `a natural person`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, `none of these`, FALSE, `a person required to attend before a House or committee`, (Date 10 3 2025), (LIST (Date 10 3 2025))))'s `I am immune from court attendance and civil arrest that day` EQUALS TRUE

